Description: PS3 (ppc64): only the nouveau and softpipe drivers, no LLVM
 The PS3 has 256 MB of RAM and an RSX (NV47). On ppc64 build softpipe and nouveau only: no
 LLVM (llvmpipe, radeonsi, zink, Vulkan; ~200 MB of LLVM/z3 in the image), valgrind, VA/VDPAU,
 video codecs or sensors; Cell CPU flags; no tests under nocheck; the VA driver move guarded.
 mesa-libgallium breaks the old ps3-mesa build (installed next to Debian's in /usr/lib/ps3-mesa),
 which its empty transitional version (26.2.4+ps3.99999) replaces.
Author: PS3 Linux project
Forwarded: not-needed
---
